OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 28 APR
OL,4,G0100FThe Spy Who Came in From the Cold
OL,5,     GLeamas is an old hand at the
OL,6,     Ggame. He knows that, in the world
OL,7,     Gof espionage, nothing is ever
OL,8,     Gwhat it seems. Stars Colin
OL,9,     GBlakely.
OL,10,G0130FShadows In Bronze
OL,11,     GThe Roman sleuth closes in on his
OL,12,     Gman, but gets more than he
OL,13,     Gbargained for from Helena's old
OL,14,     Gschool friend. Stars Anton Lesser.
OL,15,G0200FMinor Adjustment
OL,16,     GSarah's mother Bea arrives with a
OL,17,     Ghorsebox full of expressionist
OL,18,     Gart and three moulting cats.
OL,19,     GStarring Peter Davison. From 1996.
