OL,4,G0230FThe Goon Show
OL,5,     GNeddie Seagoon is suffering from
OL,6,     G'lust for gold' so organises a
OL,7,     Gdesert expedition. Stars Peter
OL,8,     GSellers. Re-recording from 1957.
OL,9,G0300FIt's a Fair Cop
OL,10,     GPoliceman turned comic Alfie
OL,11,     GMoore with tales of working some
OL,12,     Greal life cases with his police
OL,13,     Gdog, fan favourite Zeus. From
OL,14,     G2024.
OL,15,G0330FNo Room For Secrets
OL,16,     GActress Joanna Lumley reads her
OL,17,     Ghome-based autobiography - from
OL,18,     Gmodelling to acting in 'The New
OL,19,     GAvengers' and being a Bond girl.
